=== Role-A pi under LaBRADOR (succinct + post-quantum + ZERO-KNOWLEDGE) ===

Relation      : exists r : A r = t'  and  ||r||inf <= 1
Encoding      : [A | -A] w - q g = t', w BINARY (native norm type),
                g the mod-q quotient with an exact l2 bound
Witness       : 22 binary polys + 6 quotient polys, degree 256
Constraints   : 6 (one per output row)

  ||w||^2            : 1867  (binary)
  ||g||^2            : 98581   (declared bound 100000000, |g|inf = 25)

